CODEGEN.md §3.5, §5.11: the @reload value things's @cpp(name: "Things") makes its snapshot getter `const Things& Things() const`, which changes the meaning of its own container class inside the snapshot; one item meets its own name, reported against the package.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A thing.
record Thing {
  /// Its id.
  a: Int
}

/// The things.
@reload
@cpp(name: "Things")
let things: [Thing] keyed by a = [{ a: 1 }]

emit cpp { out: "@features/a", namespace: "a", mode: data }
emit json { out: "out/" }
-- a.things.json --
[{ "a": 1 }]
